  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since the mass of the string is small compared to the mass <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> , the tension force is approximately constant<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> given<br /><br />Where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo></math> Relaxed length.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> mass per unit length<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Speed of wave <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>mg</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>g</mi></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
